ode_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T23:42:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T00:04:05Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/780b49ca3b568e3a44c5b43c9e3e2ef901bf846e/core/input/input.cpp#L1600-L1604\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/780b49ca3b568e3a44c5b43c9e3e2ef901bf846e/scene/main/scene_tree.cpp#L930-L933\n\nCurrently, `application_focused` is cross-window (delayed) on x11, but not on Wayland.\n\nAs a result, when the window loses focus, the subsequent call to `Input::get_singleton()->release_pressed_events()` becomes invalid because `application_focused` remains `true`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/780b49ca3b568e3a44c5b43c9e3e2ef901bf846e/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp#L5274\n\n#118302 may be related to this, if `application_focused` is also cross-window on Mac.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4218565759/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{